# SQL Server backend support (AAP-98732).
# Installed by the py312-mssql tox environments and by the gateway container
# image (dev and runtime profiles) on top of requirements.txt, keeping the
# image complete and switchable between database backends. The ODBC stack
# stays out of the base requirements so environments that are not in the
# SQL Server tech preview (including Python 3.11) never need unixODBC.
mssql-django
dispatcherd[sqlserver]  # the sql_server Service Broker broker
